    "intro_narrative": "The world ended in fire and silence twenty years ago. You are a scavenger exploring the ruins of Sector 7, a former military research outpost buried beneath the nuclear winter. Your oxygen is running low, and the radiation storms above are closing in. Your ultimate objective is to find and extract the contents of the legendary core drive, rumored to hold the coordinates to the last uncorrupted sanctuary. But the outpost is locked down by automated defense systems and fragmented encrypted protocols. You must scour the debris, connect the surviving tech, and trace the data flow to survive.",
